WEBVTT

00:13:58.289 --> 00:14:00.113
ali oni žive u sasvim
drukčijem okruženju,

00:14:00.113 --> 00:14:04.613
pa je potrebno premostiti
razlike čulnih sistema.

00:14:04.613 --> 00:14:06.297
Hoću reći, zamislite kako bi to bilo

00:14:06.297 --> 00:14:07.906
kada bismo zaista razumeli um

00:14:07.906 --> 00:14:11.691
druge inteligentne vrste na planeti.

00:14:11.691 --> 00:14:13.039
Hvala.

00:14:13.039 --> 00:14:17.963
(Aplauz)